# Limen Finance — production build config (Arc testnet). COMMITTED on purpose: every value here is
# PUBLIC (NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined into the client bundle, so these are already world-readable on the
# live site). Server-only SECRETS (CIRCLE_API_KEY / CIRCLE_SCP_API_KEY) are NOT here — set those as
# encrypted Worker secrets in Cloudflare. `next build` loads this file on the Cloudflare build, so the
# deploy needs no NEXT_PUBLIC_* entered by hand. Values pulled from the live Vercel deployment.
